    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516540/extras/2e29603ef64c728434d019de3dc87967.avif?t=1755090035\" width=800 height=65 /></span>By some strange twist of fate, the women who bullied you in high school have returned. But you\u2019re no longer the same person during your school years. You have developed a tortured mind with disturbing insight into human nature. What will you do with them as a recreated individual?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516540/extras/f492bfa4c50454b6e2387a79ea79cb66.avif?t=1755090035\" width=800 height=65 /></span>You play as a tormented male protagonist that\u2019s capable of devious manipulation. Experiencing the foulness of human nature has caused you to see society from a bleak point of view. Letting you perceive weaknesses within every human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516540/extras/70eaa8ccdb3678d552dd11654819d6bd.avif?t=1755090035\" width=800 height=65 /></span>Seal the fate of certain characters with sheer social intelligence. You will always find ways to manipulate a situation to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516540/extras/71fe4c224f331f74d8e586d5f7f8e8ae.avif?t=1755090035\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516540/extras/87fcb0098431337486e2bbac6f9e19ce.poster.avif?t=1755090035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516540/extras/87fcb0098431337486e2bbac6f9e19ce.webm?t=1755090035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516540/extras/87fcb0098431337486e2bbac6f9e19ce.mp4?t=1755090035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lewd animations with immersive sound design.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay gallery to revisit lewd moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and outcomes shaped by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 main love interests, each with their own past and secrets.</p></li></ul>",
